<title>USA: Concurrent server picked for entertainment.</title>
<headline>Concurrent server picked for entertainment.</headline>
<dateline>FT. LAUDERDALE, Fla. 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Concurrent Computer Corp said on Tuesday Mitsubishi Electric Corp has selected its PowerMaxion digital video server to demonstrate Mitsubishi's in-flight entertainment system.</p>
<p>Mitsubishi and Concurrent publicly demonstrated the video-on-demand in-flight entertainment system for the first time at the World Airline Entertainment Association (WAEA) Conference in Seattle, Concurrent said.</p>
</text>
